          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "Published successfully as **version 1**. All supplied unit tests passed.\n\n```python\ndef count_valid_colorings(n: int, m: int) -> int:\n    mod = 998244353\n    base = m - 1\n    result = pow(base, n, mod)\n    return (result - base if n % 2 else result + base) % mod\n```\n\nUses the cycle-coloring formula \\((m-1)^n + (-1)^n(m-1)\\).\n\n**Complexity:** \\(O(\\log n)\\) time and \\(O(1)\\) auxiliary space.",
